  "notes": "Fixed source-input model, not runtime telemetry. Active/archive routes include meaningful note capture but no spec deltas. Cold resume measures orientation. Mini-app save measures its try and keep forms together against the ordinary save a mini app took before; there is no visual-author route, because the planning agent draws in the proposal. Change-specific artifacts, implementation context, and repeated agent invocations vary and are excluded. Route files are counted once. Shared loop/owner reading is included conservatively on both sides. Baseline helper counts are read from the named Git revision."
